#FUSSAREA
#AREADATA
Version      1
Name         The Hague Detention Complex~
Author       Durga~
Ranges       0 0 0 0
Economy      0 6250000
ResetFreq    15
#ENDAREADATA

#MOBILE
Vnum       9000
Keywords   dude officer intake detention~
Short      a detention intake officer~
Long       A detention intake officer reviews a prisoner's processing record here.
~
Desc       The officer wears the dark, practical uniform of the Hague detention service.
A compact terminal at one wrist displays identity records, custody orders and
medical restrictions while a body camera continuously records the processing area.
~
Race       Human~Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc~
Stats1     0 1 0 100 0 0
Stats2     1 6 0
Stats3     1 4 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    10 11 11 10 10 11 10 0
Saves      0 0 0 0 0
Speaks     common~
Speaking   common~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       9049
Keywords   dude technician detention security~
Short      a detention security technician~
Long       A detention security technician monitors a bank of diagnostic displays.
~
Desc       This technician is surrounded by quiet status panels showing locks, cameras,
life-support circuits and internal alarms throughout the detention complex. Their
attention remains fixed on the facility's systems rather than its prisoners.
~
Race       Human~Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc~
Stats1     0 1 0 100 0 0
